WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.334 --> 00:00:02.920
-We must still
unthrone her, my point.

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.796
The great love story aside.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:07.257
-She may sit on your face,
but not on your throne.

00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:10.260
It was a joke!

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:12.262
-You will see a lot
of different characters

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:15.015
who you didn't see
interact together on season one.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:19.228
-We've got a great
ensemble of actors

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.896
who bring so much
to the table.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:22.940
-Huzzah.
-Huzzah!

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.149
-You get to see the characters

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:25.943
that you enjoyed
in the first season...

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.695
developing in really fun ways.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.574
-This is great!
-We're his new best friends.

00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:36.078
-Exactly! I can be everything
Grigor was to him.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.914
-What is it, bitch?

00:00:38.956 --> 00:00:42.501
-Marial is Catherine's
cynical voice of reason.

00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:44.253
I'm quite honest with her.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.088
-You betrayed me.
-Saved.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:47.673
-Betrayed.
-Are you alive?

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.343
-Catherine still kind of holds
that over her a bit.

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:54.221
-Would you like some, Marial?
-So you do remember my name.

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:56.431
-Of course.
-ELLE: Marial and Grigor

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:59.309
had this fantastic relationship
in season two.

00:00:59.351 --> 00:01:00.602
And that's very exciting.

00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:02.980
-What are you doing?
-Changing the world.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:05.440
PHOEBE: Marial and Catherine
are both hungry for power

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:07.609
and we are using each other.

00:01:07.651 --> 00:01:11.238
-She is stubborn, yes,
but she is also brilliant.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:12.906
-I hold out my hand
in friendship.

00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:14.950
I do not want to close it
into a fist.

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:18.453
-Archie gets visions from God

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:21.415
by taking magic mushrooms
in the woods.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:22.833
-Did you see him?

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:24.042
-I saw a shining light.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:26.336
-They didn't have
such a great start.

00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:28.922
-He's the traditionalist
who wants to keep things

00:01:28.964 --> 00:01:30.549
exactly the way they are.

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:34.595
So that puts him
in opposition to Catherine.

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:37.598
-You are a German devil
who has stolen our country

00:01:37.639 --> 00:01:40.267
and is intent on burning Russia
to the ground.

00:01:40.309 --> 00:01:41.935
-Archie, be on the right side.

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:44.897
-Georgina really
admires Catherine.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:47.274
-I once felt a strong
connection with you.

00:01:47.316 --> 00:01:50.152
-We've had sex,
which I did not enjoy much.

00:01:50.194 --> 00:01:53.071
-She is in this
really unusual relationship

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.866
with both Peter
and her husband Grigor.

00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:57.951
-You summoned me?

00:01:57.993 --> 00:02:00.537
-It's an interesting
little love triangle, I suppose.

00:02:00.579 --> 00:02:03.290
Grigor is Peter's
best friend and confidant.

00:02:03.332 --> 00:02:04.958
-You need to shut up.

00:02:05.584 --> 00:02:09.213
-I'm worried
his love for Catherine
is a brake on our plans.

00:02:09.254 --> 00:02:11.715
-I do not love her.
-Huzzah!

00:02:11.757 --> 00:02:13.467
-Grigor is probably one of
the few people in the court

00:02:13.509 --> 00:02:17.387
who Peter can really be himself
and show his weakness.

00:02:17.429 --> 00:02:19.806
-Seems a bit strong.
She came to me unbidden.

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:21.558
-You must make her believe

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.352
there is more to you
than there is.

00:02:24.728 --> 00:02:26.647
-Elizabeth is really
interesting because on one hand,

00:02:26.688 --> 00:02:28.690
she's a bit
of a political player.

00:02:29.399 --> 00:02:31.610
But she's also
a bit of a bohemian.

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:35.030
-You put a crown on a donkey,
it is still a donkey.

00:02:35.072 --> 00:02:38.242
-She realizes that Catherine,
I think, has amazing attributes

00:02:38.283 --> 00:02:40.285
that would make her
a brilliant leader.

00:02:40.744 --> 00:02:44.206
-The joy of being a woman
is knowing that we have unseen

00:02:44.248 --> 00:02:47.125
and unacknowledged depths
and strengths

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:49.127
beyond anything
a man will ever know.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:51.880
-Oh, right. Of course. Sorry.

00:02:53.507 --> 00:02:56.301
-Velementov is still very
old-fashioned in my thoughts

00:02:56.343 --> 00:02:59.972
about whether a woman, and a
young woman, can actually lead.

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:03.016
-I shall ready battle plans.
-What is wrong with you?

00:03:03.225 --> 00:03:06.103
-A general readies war plans,
it's sort of the job.

00:03:06.645 --> 00:03:08.647
-There's a sort of journey
to go on with her

00:03:08.689 --> 00:03:10.732
where I gradually
believe in her.

00:03:10.774 --> 00:03:13.443
-It's a war order.
I take it personally.

00:03:13.485 --> 00:03:15.112
-She dies.
He comes back.

00:03:16.446 --> 00:03:19.199
-Catherine
and Orlo together,

00:03:19.241 --> 00:03:21.285
they'll bring the best
out of one another,

00:03:21.326 --> 00:03:24.329
making Russia great again.

00:03:24.371 --> 00:03:26.748
-In one moment,
58 million people are freed.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:30.294
-Steps.
A mile is made in steps.

00:03:30.335 --> 00:03:33.964
-I teach Catherine how to play
the game here at the palace.

00:03:34.006 --> 00:03:38.177
-Head, not heart, Catherine.
-Reason, not rage, Orlo.

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:42.764
-And Catherine teaches Orlo
to live dangerously.

00:03:42.806 --> 00:03:44.641
Be fearless
and take some big risks.

00:03:44.683 --> 00:03:47.519
-I had sex last night
with a woman.
-Cute.

00:03:47.561 --> 00:03:50.105
-I like that you're fitting
all these different characters

00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:51.940
together that
might not quite fit.

00:03:51.982 --> 00:03:54.318
I think from that comes
really exciting ideas.

00:03:55.444 --> 00:03:56.445
Huzzah.

